<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND ALL OUT 311 V PAKISTAN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND ALL OUT 311 V PAKISTAN.</headline>
<dateline>LAHORE, Pakistan 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were all out</p>
<p>for 311 on the third day of the first test on Saturday, setting</p>
<p>Pakistan a victory target of 275.</p>
<p>Scores: New Zealand 155 and 311; Pakistan 191.</p>
